<title>POLAND: POLISH BOURSE KERB BOND DEALS - MARCH 10.</title>
<headline>POLISH BOURSE KERB BOND DEALS - MARCH 10.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kerb bond trade through the Warsaw bourse on Monday saw 507,179 variable-interest one-year bonds maturing on March 4, 1998 trading at 98 zlotys each.</p>
<p>Their turnover was 50.1 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
